{"overview":"سوزان رایلند پس از بازگشت به انگلستان، ناخواسته در معمای جدیدی از آتیکوس پوند که این بار توسط نویسنده‌ای جوان نوشته شده، درگیر می‌شود. «آخرین پروندهٔ پوند» داستانی است در سال ۱۹۵۵، در یک ویلاِ عجیب و غریب در کورفو – اما هویت قاتل واقعی در متن پنهان شده و بار دیگر سوزان در خطر جدی قرار می‌گیرد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Returning to England, Susan Ryeland is reluctantly drawn into a new Atticus Pünd mystery, this time written by a new, young writer. 'Pünd’s Last Case\" is a story set in 1955, in an exotic villa in Corfu – but the identity of a real killer is hidden in the text, and once again Susan is going to find herself in grave danger.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":6,"y":2026,"poster":"/6Da4NeRiy74q3DeO756CzfYlSoK.jpg"}],"episodes":6,"crew":["Rebecca Gatward"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["GB","IE"],"cast":[{"name":"لسلی منویل","role":"Susan Ryeland","photo":"/tioPlSoypjdME3oMu3g7XmgIIKS.jpg","en":"Lesley Manville"},{"name":"Tim McMullan","role":"Atticus Pünd","photo":"/7RaL5N5riQlgdjEvgK4hWJie4mc.jpg"}],"trailer":"DMCyCJoxgTY","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/283319-marble-hall-murders/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"PBS Masterpiece Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/aZASQOdPFvGnXiJ015OVGVJ9vt7.png"},{"n":"Amazon Video","kind":"buy","logo":"/jn6TLbtaTZntTRX9UYucHJvpQx1.png"},{"n":"Apple TV Store","kind":"buy","logo":"/qdEGArH3lKfFnAtYXMkSYk5wxuG.png"},{"n":"Google Play Movies","kind":"buy","logo":"/aZRENwYILujqs0RVOZutTh0BVGV.png"},{"n":"Fandango At Home","kind":"buy","logo":"/wpOt6x0dRxTrIzuBosto4LGd7E9.png"}]},"GB":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/283319-marble-hall-murders/watch?locale=GB","p":[{"n":"Sky Go","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/1Yvl9eP3pmktqChitnFhHJHcBtX.png"},{"n":"BBC iPlayer","kind":"free","logo":"/vi6XJCpJ9GpAPD3rDSRzMC812Z.png"}]},"CA":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/283319-marble-hall-murders/watch?locale=CA","p":[{"n":"PBS Maste